</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4359" data-end=3D"4381">=F0=9F=93=A6 Il est compos=C3=A9 d=
e :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4382" data-end=3D"4582">
<li data-start=3D"4382" data-end=3D"4450">
<p data-start=3D"4384" data-end=3D"4450"><strong data-start=3D"4384" data-e=
nd=3D"4413">Docker Daemon (<code data-start=3D"4401" data-end=3D"4410">dock=
erd</code>)</strong> : service qui ex=C3=A9cute les conteneurs</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4451" data-end=3D"4505">
<p data-start=3D"4453" data-end=3D"4505"><strong data-start=3D"4453" data-e=
nd=3D"4478">Docker CLI (<code data-start=3D"4467" data-end=3D"4475">docker<=
/code>)</strong> : ligne de commande client</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4506" data-end=3D"4582">
<p data-start=3D"4508" data-end=3D"4582"><strong data-start=3D"4508" data-e=
nd=3D"4520">API REST</strong> : utilis=C3=A9e par des outils tiers (Portain=
er, Kubernetes, etc.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4584" data-end=3D"4684">=F0=9F=92=A1 Le moteur Docker est =
souvent install=C3=A9 sur Linux. Sur Windows/macOS, il est encapsul=C3=A9 d=
ans une VM.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4686" data-end=3D"4689">
<h3 data-start=3D"4691" data-end=3D"4712">=F0=9F=92=BB 2.2 Docker CLI</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4714" data-end=3D"4786">C=E2=80=99est l=E2=80=99outil en l=
igne de commande principal pour interagir avec Docker.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4788" data-end=3D"4814">=F0=9F=93=9C <strong data-start=3D=
"4791" data-end=3D"4812">Commandes de base</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4815" data-end=3D"5038">
<li data-start=3D"4815" data-end=3D"4851">
<p data-start=3D"4817" data-end=3D"4851"><code data-start=3D"4817" data-end=
=3D"4829">docker run</code> =E2=80=93 lancer un conteneur</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4852" data-end=3D"4889">
<p data-start=3D"4854" data-end=3D"4889"><code data-start=3D"4854" data-end=
=3D"4865">docker ps</code> =E2=80=93 lister les conteneurs</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4890" data-end=3D"4929">
<p data-start=3D"4892" data-end=3D"4929"><code data-start=3D"4892" data-end=
=3D"4906">docker build</code> =E2=80=93 construire une image</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4930" data-end=3D"4987">
<p data-start=3D"4932" data-end=3D"4987"><code data-start=3D"4932" data-end=
=3D"4945">docker exec</code> =E2=80=93 ex=C3=A9cuter une commande dans un c=
onteneur</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4988" data-end=3D"5038">
<p data-start=3D"4990" data-end=3D"5038"><code data-start=3D"4990" data-end=
=3D"5003">docker logs</code> =E2=80=93 afficher les logs d=E2=80=99un conte=
neur</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"5040" data-end=3D"5116">=F0=9F=A7=AA Utilisable dans tous =
les scripts CI/CD, terminaux, jobs d=E2=80=99automatisation.</p>
<p data-start=3D"5118" data-end=3D"5180">=F0=9F=92=A1 Peut aussi communique=
r avec un h=C3=B4te Docker distant via TCP.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5182" data-end=3D"5185">
<h3 data-start=3D"5187" data-end=3D"5213">=F0=9F=96=A5=EF=B8=8F 2.3 Docker =
Desktop</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5215" data-end=3D"5275"><strong data-start=3D"5215" data-e=
nd=3D"5238">Interface graphique</strong> pour macOS et Windows qui facilite=
 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5277" data-end=3D"5488">
<li data-start=3D"5277" data-end=3D"5335">
<p data-start=3D"5279" data-end=3D"5335">L=E2=80=99installation de Docker E=
ngine sur une VM Linux interne</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5336" data-end=3D"5398">
<p data-start=3D"5338" data-end=3D"5398">La gestion visuelle des conteneurs=
, images, volumes, r=C3=A9seaux</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5399" data-end=3D"5437">
<p data-start=3D"5401" data-end=3D"5437">L=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s aux logs, mon=
itoring basique</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5438" data-end=3D"5488">
<p data-start=3D"5440" data-end=3D"5488">Le param=C3=A9trage (proxies, ress=
ources, extensions)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"5490" data-end=3D"5507">=F0=9F=93=A6 Inclus aussi :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5508" data-end=3D"5571">
<li data-start=3D"5508" data-end=3D"5520">
<p data-start=3D"5510" data-end=3D"5520">Docker CLI</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5521" data-end=3D"5537">
<p data-start=3D"5523" data-end=3D"5537">Docker Compose</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5538" data-end=3D"5571">
<p data-start=3D"5540" data-end=3D"5571">Kubernetes en local (optionnel)</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"5573" data-end=3D"5670">=F0=9F=8E=AF Destin=C3=A9 aux d=C3=
=A9veloppeurs qui souhaitent un environnement pr=C3=AAt =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99em=
ploi et simple =C3=A0 utiliser.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5672" data-end=3D"5675">
<h3 data-start=3D"5677" data-end=3D"5698">=F0=9F=8C=90 2.4 Docker Hub</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5700" data-end=3D"5754">C=E2=80=99est le <strong data-star=
t=3D"5709" data-end=3D"5753">registre public officiel d=E2=80=99images Dock=
er</strong>.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"5756" data-end=3D"5786">=E2=9C=A8 Fonctions principales :=
</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5787" data-end=3D"6036">
<li data-start=3D"5787" data-end=3D"5868">
<p data-start=3D"5789" data-end=3D"5868"><strong data-start=3D"5789" data-e=
nd=3D"5815">T=C3=A9l=C3=A9charger des images</strong> avec <code data-start=
=3D"5821" data-end=3D"5834">docker pull</code> (ex : <code data-start=3D"58=
41" data-end=3D"5848">nginx</code>, <code data-start=3D"5850" data-end=3D"5=
857">mysql</code>, <code data-start=3D"5859" data-end=3D"5867">python</code=
>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5869" data-end=3D"5920">
<p data-start=3D"5871" data-end=3D"5920"><strong data-start=3D"5871" data-e=
nd=3D"5901">Publier ses propres images</strong> avec <code data-start=3D"59=
07" data-end=3D"5920">docker push</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5921" data-end=3D"5991">
<p data-start=3D"5923" data-end=3D"5991"><strong data-start=3D"5923" data-e=
nd=3D"5945">Recherche d=E2=80=99images</strong> (avec tags, documentation, =
notes de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5992" data-end=3D"6036">
<p data-start=3D"5994" data-end=3D"6036"><strong data-start=3D"5994" data-e=
nd=3D"6036">Organiser des d=C3=A9p=C3=B4ts priv=C3=A9s ou publics</strong><=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
