<p data-start=3D"2215" data-end=3D"2315">=F0=9F=A7=A0 La CLI <strong data-s=
tart=3D"2225" data-end=3D"2259">n=E2=80=99interagit jamais directement</str=
ong> avec les conteneurs : elle parle =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"2295" data=
-end=3D"2304">dockerd</code> via l=E2=80=99API.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2317" data-end=3D"2320">
<h3 data-start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2343">2.4 Docker Images</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2345" data-end=3D"2467">Les <strong data-start=3D"2349" da=
ta-end=3D"2366">images Docker</strong> sont des instantan=C3=A9s <strong da=
ta-start=3D"2388" data-end=3D"2401">immuables</strong> qui contiennent tout=
 ce qu=E2=80=99il faut pour ex=C3=A9cuter une application.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2469" data-end=3D"2644">
<li data-start=3D"2469" data-end=3D"2498">
<p data-start=3D"2471" data-end=3D"2498">Cr=C3=A9es via un <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2484" data-end=3D"2498">Dockerfile</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2499" data-end=3D"2568">
<p data-start=3D"2501" data-end=3D"2568">Construites par le moteur Docker (=
via <code data-start=3D"2539" data-end=3D"2549">buildkit</code> ou <code da=
ta-start=3D"2553" data-end=3D"2567">docker build</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2569" data-end=3D"2612">
<p data-start=3D"2571" data-end=3D"2612">Stock=C3=A9es en couches (layered =
file system)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2613" data-end=3D"2644">
<p data-start=3D"2615" data-end=3D"2644">Versionn=C3=A9es avec des <strong =
data-start=3D"2636" data-end=3D"2644">tags</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2646" data-end=3D"2725">=F0=9F=94=81 Peuvent =C3=AAtre tra=
nsf=C3=A9r=C3=A9es via un registre (Docker Hub, GitLab Registry, etc.)</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2727" data-end=3D"2730">
<h3 data-start=3D"2732" data-end=3D"2757">2.5 Docker Containers</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2759" data-end=3D"2899">Un <strong data-start=3D"2762" dat=
a-end=3D"2775">conteneur</strong> est une instance <strong data-start=3D"27=
93" data-end=3D"2804">runtime</strong> d=E2=80=99une image. C=E2=80=99est u=
n processus isol=C3=A9 ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 dans un espace d=C3=A9di=C3=A9 (na=
mespace Linux + cgroup).</p>
<p data-start=3D"2901" data-end=3D"2922">=F0=9F=93=8C Caract=C3=A9ristiques=
 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2923" data-end=3D"3101">
<li data-start=3D"2923" data-end=3D"2961">
<p data-start=3D"2925" data-end=3D"2961">Ephemeral (sauf si volumes utilis=
=C3=A9s)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2962" data-end=3D"3001">
<p data-start=3D"2964" data-end=3D"3001">Isol=C3=A9 (r=C3=A9seau, processus=
, filesystem)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3002" data-end=3D"3040">
<p data-start=3D"3004" data-end=3D"3040">L=C3=A9ger (partage le noyau avec =
l=E2=80=99h=C3=B4te)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3041" data-end=3D"3101">
<p data-start=3D"3043" data-end=3D"3101">Peut =C3=AAtre li=C3=A9 =C3=A0 d=
=E2=80=99autres conteneurs via des r=C3=A9seaux Docker</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3103" data-end=3D"3106">
<h3 data-start=3D"3108" data-end=3D"3131">2.6 Docker Registry</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3133" data-end=3D"3196">Un <strong data-start=3D"3136" dat=
a-end=3D"3148">registre</strong> Docker est un syst=C3=A8me de distribution=
 d=E2=80=99images.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3198" data-end=3D"3348">
<li data-start=3D"3198" data-end=3D"3249">
<p data-start=3D"3200" data-end=3D"3249"><strong data-start=3D"3200" data-e=
nd=3D"3214">Docker Hub</strong> est le registre public par d=C3=A9faut.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3250" data-end=3D"3303">
<p data-start=3D"3252" data-end=3D"3303">Peut =C3=AAtre priv=C3=A9 (Harbor,=
 GitLab, Amazon ECR, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3348">
<p data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3348">Utilis=C3=A9 avec <code data-start=
=3D"3319" data-end=3D"3332">docker pull</code>, <code data-start=3D"3334" d=
ata-end=3D"3347">docker push</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3350" data-end=3D"3414">=F0=9F=94=90 Possibilit=C3=A9 d=E2=
=80=99authentification, scan de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, audit, etc.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3416" data-end=3D"3419">
<h3 data-start=3D"3421" data-end=3D"3443">2.7 Docker Compose</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3445" data-end=3D"3534">Outil pour d=C3=A9finir et ex=C3=
