lement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1714" data-end=3D"1752">
<p data-start=3D"1716" data-end=3D"1752">Int=C3=A9gration directe avec Dock=
er Hub.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1753" data-end=3D"1787">
<p data-start=3D"1755" data-end=3D"1787">Configuration r=C3=A9seau simplifi=
=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
