<hr data-start=3D"460" data-end=3D"463">
<h2 data-start=3D"465" data-end=3D"480">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectifs</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"482" data-end=3D"873">
<li data-start=3D"482" data-end=3D"533">
<p data-start=3D"484" data-end=3D"533">Comprendre ce qu=E2=80=99est le daem=
