=80=9Cslim=E2=80=9D ou =E2=80=9Cminimal=E2=80=9D des d=C3=A9pendances.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3297" data-end=3D"3343">
<p data-start=3D"3299" data-end=3D"3343">Retire les fichiers inutiles (doc,=
 locales).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3345" data-end=3D"3348">
<h3 data-start=3D"3350" data-end=3D"3393">2. Suppression des fichiers tempo=
