<ul data-start=3D"3395" data-end=3D"3464">
<li data-start=3D"3395" data-end=3D"3464">
<p data-start=3D"3397" data-end=3D"3464">Supprime les fichiers temporaires,=
 caches, logs, fichiers inutiles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3466" data-end=3D"3469">
<h3 data-start=3D"3471" data-end=3D"3502">3. Limiter l=E2=80=99usage de <co=
