<p data-start=3D"3506" data-end=3D"3619">Utilise plut=C3=B4t <code data-sta=
rt=3D"3521" data-end=3D"3527">COPY</code>, <code data-start=3D"3529" data-e=
nd=3D"3534">ADD</code> peut d=C3=A9compresser automatiquement les archives,=
 ce qui peut complexifier la gestion.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3621" data-end=3D"3624">
<h3 data-start=3D"3626" data-end=3D"3655">4. Compression de l=E2=80=99image=
</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3657" data-end=3D"3789">
<li data-start=3D"3657" data-end=3D"3725">
