<ul data-start=3D"4520" data-end=3D"4561">
<li data-start=3D"4520" data-end=3D"4561">
<p data-start=3D"4522" data-end=3D"4561">Pour b=C3=A9n=C3=A9ficier des patc=
hs de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4563" data-end=3D"4566">
<h3 data-start=3D"4568" data-end=3D"4593">4. Scanner les images</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4595" data-end=3D"4621">Utilise des outils comme :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4623" data-end=3D"4663">
<li data-start=3D"4623" data-end=3D"4647">
<p data-start=3D"4625" data-end=3D"4647"><code data-start=3D"4625" data-end=
=3D"4647">docker scan monimage</code></p>
