</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1320" data-end=3D"1399">Docker <strong data-start=3D"1327"=
 data-end=3D"1347">capture ces flux</strong> et les stocke selon le <strong=
 data-start=3D"1371" data-end=3D"1388">driver de log</strong> configur=C3=
=A9.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1401" data-end=3D"1495">Par d=C3=A9faut, Docker utilise <c=
ode data-start=3D"1428" data-end=3D"1439">json-file</code>, qui enregistre =
les logs dans un fichier local en JSON.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1497" data-end=3D"1500">
<h2 data-start=3D"1502" data-end=3D"1533">2. =F0=9F=A7=B1 Fonctionnement in=
terne</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1535" data-end=3D"1619">Les logs de conteneurs sont g=C3=
=A9n=C3=A9r=C3=A9s par le processus principal (PID 1) du conteneur.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1621" data-end=3D"1688">Docker intercepte les flux via des=
 <strong data-start=3D"1656" data-end=3D"1670">pipes UNIX</strong> et les r=
edirige :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1690" data-end=3D"1816">
<li data-start=3D"1690" data-end=3D"1737">
<p data-start=3D"1692" data-end=3D"1737">Soit dans des fichiers (<code data=
-start=3D"1716" data-end=3D"1727">json-file</code>, <code data-start=3D"172=
9" data-end=3D"1736">local</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1738" data-end=3D"1816">
<p data-start=3D"1740" data-end=3D"1816">Soit vers un syst=C3=A8me externe =
(<code data-start=3D"1770" data-end=3D"1778">syslog</code>, <code data-star=
t=3D"1780" data-end=3D"1790">journald</code>, <code data-start=3D"1792" dat=
a-end=3D"1801">fluentd</code>, <code data-start=3D"1803" data-end=3D"1809">=
gelf</code>, etc.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1818" data-end=3D"1922">
<p data-start=3D"1820" data-end=3D"1922">Les logs sont stock=C3=A9s dans <c=
ode data-start=3D"1847" data-end=3D"1894">/var/lib/docker/containers/&lt;id=
&gt;/&lt;id&gt;-json.log</code> pour le driver <code data-start=3D"1910" da=
ta-end=3D"1921">json-file</code>.</p>
</blockquote>
