<h2 data-start=3D"2941" data-end=3D"2987">5. =F0=9F=94=81 Mise =C3=A0 jour =
continue (Rolling Update)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2989" data-end=3D"3074">Une des forces de Swarm : <strong =
data-start=3D"3015" data-end=3D"3042">mise =C3=A0 jour progressive</strong>=
 d=E2=80=99un service sans interruption.</p>
