<hr data-start=3D"7069" data-end=3D"7072">
<h2 data-start=3D"7074" data-end=3D"7124">3. Concepts avanc=C3=A9s =C3=A0 d=
=C3=A9couvrir pour progresser</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7126" data-end=3D"7559">
<li data-start=3D"7126" data-end=3D"7205">
<p data-start=3D"7128" data-end=3D"7205"><strong data-start=3D"7128" data-e=
nd=3D"7144">StatefulSets</strong> : d=C3=A9ploiement pour applications avec=
 =C3=A9tat (bases de donn=C3=A9es)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7206" data-end=3D"7282">
<p data-start=3D"7208" data-end=3D"7282"><strong data-start=3D"7208" data-e=
nd=3D"7232">ConfigMaps &amp; Secrets</strong> : gestion s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e=
 des configurations et secrets</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7283" data-end=3D"7358">
<p data-start=3D"7285" data-end=3D"7358"><strong data-start=3D"7285" data-e=
nd=3D"7307">Ingress Controller</strong> : routage HTTP avanc=C3=A9, SSL, do=
maines personnalis=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7359" data-end=3D"7403">
<p data-start=3D"7361" data-end=3D"7403"><strong data-start=3D"7361" data-e=
nd=3D"7369">Helm</strong> : gestion des packages Kubernetes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7404" data-end=3D"7455">
<p data-start=3D"7406" data-end=3D"7455"><strong data-start=3D"7406" data-e=
nd=3D"7421">Autoscaling</strong> : Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7456" data-end=3D"7513">
<p data-start=3D"7458" data-end=3D"7513"><strong data-start=3D"7458" data-e=
nd=3D"7471">Operators</strong> : automatisation d=E2=80=99applications comp=
lexes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7514" data-end=3D"7559">
<p data-start=3D"7516" data-end=3D"7559"><strong data-start=3D"7516" data-e=
nd=3D"7524">RBAC</strong> : gestion des acc=C3=A8s et permissions</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7561" data-end=3D"7564">
<h2 data-start=3D"7566" data-end=3D"7582">4. Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7584" data-end=3D"7846">Kubernetes est une solution puissa=
nte et complexe, mais incontournable d=C3=A8s qu=E2=80=99on cherche =C3=A0 =
d=C3=A9ployer des applications conteneuris=C3=A9es =C3=A0 grande =C3=A9chel=
le. Il enrichit Docker par une orchestration avanc=C3=A9e, une meilleure ge=
stion des ressources, et un =C3=A9cosyst=C3=A8me mature.</p>
<p data-start=3D"7848" data-end=3D"7887">Pour d=C3=A9marrer, familiarisez-v=
ous avec :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7889" data-end=3D"8003">
