ments et services</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7938" data-end=3D"7956">
<p data-start=3D"7940" data-end=3D"7956">La CLI <code data-start=3D"7947" d=
ata-end=3D"7956">kubectl</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7957" data-end=3D"8003">
<p data-start=3D"7959" data-end=3D"8003">Le cycle de vie d=E2=80=99un pod e=
t d=E2=80=99un d=C3=A9ploiement</p>
</li>
</ul>
