=C3=A9tranglement (CPU, m=C3=A9moire, IO).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1203" data-end=3D"1246">
<p data-start=3D"1205" data-end=3D"1246">Optimiser la consommation des ress=
ources.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1247" data-end=3D"1302">
<p data-start=3D"1249" data-end=3D"1302">D=C3=A9tecter des fuites m=C3=A9mo=
ire ou des processus bloqu=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1303" data-end=3D"1350">
<p data-start=3D"1305" data-end=3D"1350">Assurer la scalabilit=C3=A9 effica=
ce des services.</p>
</li>
</ul>
