<hr data-start=3D"4546" data-end=3D"4549">
<h3 data-start=3D"4551" data-end=3D"4577">3.2 Ambassador pattern</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"4579" data-end=3D"4594">D=C3=A9finition</h4>
<p data-start=3D"4596" data-end=3D"4860">Le pattern <strong data-start=3D"4=
607" data-end=3D"4621">Ambassador</strong> est un conteneur qui agit comme =
un proxy entre une application et des services externes (base de donn=C3=A9=
es, API tierces=E2=80=A6). Il encapsule la communication, ajoute des foncti=
onnalit=C3=A9s (authentification, caching), et simplifie la configuration.<=
/p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4862" data-end=3D"4876">Avantages</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4878" data-end=3D"5017">
<li data-start=3D"4878" data-end=3D"4933">
<p data-start=3D"4880" data-end=3D"4933">D=C3=A9couplage du code applicatif=
 et de la gestion r=C3=A9seau</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4934" data-end=3D"5017">
<p data-start=3D"4936" data-end=3D"5017">Facilit=C3=A9 de test et modificat=
ion des services externes sans changer l=E2=80=99application</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5019" data-end=3D"5031">Exemple</h4>
<p data-start=3D"5033" data-end=3D"5138">Un conteneur Ambassador qui g=C3=
=A8re les connexions =C3=A0 une base de donn=C3=A9es distante, avec gestion=
 des retries.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5140" data-end=3D"5143">
<h3 data-start=3D"5145" data-end=3D"5175">3.3 Init-Container pattern</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"5177" data-end=3D"5192">D=C3=A9finition</h4>
<p data-start=3D"5194" data-end=3D"5410">Un <strong data-start=3D"5197" dat=
a-end=3D"5215">init-container</strong> est un conteneur sp=C3=A9cial qui s=
=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cute avant le conteneur principal dans un Pod. Il pr=C3=A9=
pare l=E2=80=99environnement (chargement de fichiers de configuration, migr=
ation de base de donn=C3=A9es, setup r=C3=A9seau).</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"5412" data-end=3D"5436">Utilisation typique</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5438" data-end=3D"5572">
<li data-start=3D"5438" data-end=3D"5472">
<p data-start=3D"5440" data-end=3D"5472">Initialiser des bases de donn=C3=
=A9es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5473" data-end=3D"5507">
<p data-start=3D"5475" data-end=3D"5507">Pr=C3=A9parer des fichiers ou secr=
ets</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5508" data-end=3D"5572">
<p data-start=3D"5510" data-end=3D"5572">V=C3=A9rifier la disponibilit=C3=
=A9 d=E2=80=99un service externe avant d=C3=A9marrage</p>
</li>
</ul>
