<hr data-start=3D"3700" data-end=3D"3703">
<h3 data-start=3D"3705" data-end=3D"3761">1.5 Bonnes pratiques autour des d=
onn=C3=A9es persistantes</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3763" data-end=3D"4161">
<li data-start=3D"3763" data-end=3D"3856">
<p data-start=3D"3765" data-end=3D"3856">Toujours externaliser les donn=C3=
=A9es critiques dans des volumes Docker ou un stockage externe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3857" data-end=3D"3958">
<p data-start=3D"3859" data-end=3D"3958">Ne pas stocker les donn=C3=A9es im=
portantes uniquement dans le syst=C3=A8me de fichiers interne du conteneur.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3959" data-end=3D"4016">
<p data-start=3D"3961" data-end=3D"4016">Automatiser la sauvegarde des volu=
mes (backup/restore).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4017" data-end=3D"4090">
<p data-start=3D"4019" data-end=3D"4090">Utiliser des volumes nomm=C3=A9s p=
our faciliter la gestion multi-containers.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4091" data-end=3D"4161">
<p data-start=3D"4093" data-end=3D"4161">S=C3=A9curiser les acc=C3=A8s aux =
volumes via permissions et contr=C3=B4le d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4163" data-end=3D"4166">
<h2 data-start=3D"4168" data-end=3D"4227">2. Conteneurs Rootless (Conteneur=
s sans privil=C3=A8ges root)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4229" data-end=3D"4249">2.1 Introduction</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4251" data-end=3D"4499">Par d=C3=A9faut, Docker n=C3=A9ces=
site des privil=C3=A8ges root pour g=C3=A9rer le d=C3=A9mon Docker (<code d=
ata-start=3D"4328" data-end=3D"4337">dockerd</code>) et lancer les conteneu=
rs. Cela pose un risque de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 important car un exploit dans=
 Docker ou dans un conteneur peut donner un acc=C3=A8s root =C3=A0 la machi=
ne h=C3=B4te.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4501" data-end=3D"4705">Le mode <strong data-start=3D"4509=
" data-end=3D"4521">rootless</strong> permet d=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cuter Docker=
 et ses conteneurs sans droits root, ce qui am=C3=A9liore consid=C3=A9rable=
ment la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, notamment sur des machines partag=C3=A9es ou en=
 environnement multi-utilisateurs.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4707" data-end=3D"4710">
<h3 data-start=3D"4712" data-end=3D"4756">2.2 Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=E2=80=99=
un conteneur rootless ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4758" data-end=3D"5112">
<li data-start=3D"4758" data-end=3D"4851">
<p data-start=3D"4760" data-end=3D"4851">Docker rootless fonctionne sans qu=
e le d=C3=A9mon Docker (<code data-start=3D"4813" data-end=3D"4822">dockerd=
</code>) ne tourne en tant que root.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4852" data-end=3D"4928">
<p data-start=3D"4854" data-end=3D"4928">Le d=C3=A9mon et les conteneurs s=
=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cutent sous un utilisateur non privil=C3=A9gi=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4929" data-end=3D"5001">
<p data-start=3D"4931" data-end=3D"5001">Limite la surface d=E2=80=99attaqu=
e en isolant compl=C3=A8tement Docker du syst=C3=A8me.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5002" data-end=3D"5112">
<p data-start=3D"5004" data-end=3D"5112">Fonctionne via des m=C3=A9canismes=
 de namespaces utilisateur (<code data-start=3D"5061" data-end=3D"5078">use=
r namespaces</code>) et autres fonctionnalit=C3=A9s Linux.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5114" data-end=3D"5117">
<h3 data-start=3D"5119" data-end=3D"5162">2.3 Pourquoi utiliser Docker root=
less ?</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"5164" data-end=3D"5180">Avantages :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5182" data-end=3D"5491">
<li data-start=3D"5182" data-end=3D"5273">
<p data-start=3D"5184" data-end=3D"5273"><strong data-start=3D"5184" data-e=
nd=3D"5206">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 renforc=C3=A9e</strong> : Pas d=E2=80=99acc=
=C3=A8s root requis, donc moins de risques en cas de faille.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5274" data-end=3D"5378">
<p data-start=3D"5276" data-end=3D"5378"><strong data-start=3D"5276" data-e=
nd=3D"5301">Isolation utilisateur</strong> : Chaque utilisateur peut ex=C3=
=A9cuter son propre Docker rootless, sans conflit.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5379" data-end=3D"5491">
<p data-start=3D"5381" data-end=3D"5491"><strong data-start=3D"5381" data-e=
nd=3D"5421">Utilisation en environnement partag=C3=A9</strong> : Parfait po=
ur les environnements o=C3=B9 les droits root sont restreints.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5493" data-end=3D"5511">Limitations :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5513" data-end=3D"5737">
<li data-start=3D"5513" data-end=3D"5619">
<p data-start=3D"5515" data-end=3D"5619">Certaines fonctionnalit=C3=A9s Doc=
ker ne sont pas disponibles ou limit=C3=A9es (ex : gestion avanc=C3=A9e des=
 r=C3=A9seaux).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5620" data-end=3D"5656">
<p data-start=3D"5622" data-end=3D"5656">Performances l=C3=A9g=C3=A8rement =
impact=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5657" data-end=3D"5737">
<p data-start=3D"5659" data-end=3D"5737">Support et compatibilit=C3=A9 avec=
 tous les syst=C3=A8mes d=E2=80=99exploitation peuvent varier.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5739" data-end=3D"5742">
<h3 data-start=3D"5744" data-end=3D"5798">2.4 Installation et utilisation d=
e Docker rootless</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"5800" data-end=3D"5814">Pr=C3=A9requis</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5816" data-end=3D"5937">
<li data-start=3D"5816" data-end=3D"5859">
<p data-start=3D"5818" data-end=3D"5859">Linux r=C3=A9cent (kernel &gt;=3D =
4.18 recommand=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5860" data-end=3D"5937">
<p data-start=3D"5862" data-end=3D"5937">User namespaces activ=C3=A9s (<cod=
e data-start=3D"5887" data-end=3D"5931">/proc/sys/kernel/unprivileged_usern=
s_clone</code> =3D 1).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5939" data-end=3D"5942">
<h4 data-start=3D"5944" data-end=3D"5961">Installation</h4>
<ol data-start=3D"5963" data-end=3D"6042">
<li data-start=3D"5963" data-end=3D"6002">
<p data-start=3D"5966" data-end=3D"6002">Installer Docker (comme d=E2=80=99=
habitude).</p>
