<p data-start=3D"6409" data-end=3D"6505">Le d=C3=A9mon et conteneurs tourne=
nt sans privil=C3=A8ge root, ce qui r=C3=A9duit consid=C3=A9rablement les r=
isques.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6507" data-end=3D"6510">
<h3 data-start=3D"6512" data-end=3D"6544">2.5 Fonctionnement technique</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6546" data-end=3D"6617">Docker rootless s=E2=80=99appuie s=
ur plusieurs fonctionnalit=C3=A9s Linux avanc=C3=A9es :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6619" data-end=3D"6978">
<li data-start=3D"6619" data-end=3D"6731">
<p data-start=3D"6621" data-end=3D"6731"><strong data-start=3D"6621" data-e=
nd=3D"6640">User namespaces</strong> : Permettent de mapper les UID/GID dan=
s le conteneur =C3=A0 un utilisateur non-root sur l=E2=80=99h=C3=B4te.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6732" data-end=3D"6813">
<p data-start=3D"6734" data-end=3D"6813"><strong data-start=3D"6734" data-e=
nd=3D"6756">Network namespaces</strong> : Gestion limit=C3=A9e du r=C3=A9se=
au pour l=E2=80=99utilisateur non-root.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6814" data-end=3D"6903">
<p data-start=3D"6816" data-end=3D"6903"><strong data-start=3D"6816" data-e=
nd=3D"6834">FUSE Overlayfs</strong> : Pour la gestion du syst=C3=A8me de fi=
chiers superpos=C3=A9 sans droits root.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6904" data-end=3D"6978">
<p data-start=3D"6906" data-end=3D"6978"><strong data-start=3D"6906" data-e=
nd=3D"6931">Systemd user services</strong> : Pour g=C3=A9rer le d=C3=A9mon =
Docker en mode rootless.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6980" data-end=3D"6983">
<h3 data-start=3D"6985" data-end=3D"7032">2.6 Cas d=E2=80=99usage typiques =
de Docker rootless</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7034" data-end=3D"7307">
<li data-start=3D"7034" data-end=3D"7111">
<p data-start=3D"7036" data-end=3D"7111">Environnements multi-utilisateurs =
o=C3=B9 chacun ex=C3=A9cute ses propres conteneurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7112" data-end=3D"7181">
<p data-start=3D"7114" data-end=3D"7181">D=C3=A9veloppement local s=C3=A9cu=
ris=C3=A9 sans risque d=E2=80=99alt=C3=A9rer la machine h=C3=B4te.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7182" data-end=3D"7244">
<p data-start=3D"7184" data-end=3D"7244">Plateformes de formation ou sandbo=
x Docker sans droits root.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7245" data-end=3D"7307">
<p data-start=3D"7247" data-end=3D"7307">Int=C3=A9gration CI/CD sur des run=
ners ou agents non privil=C3=A9gi=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
