<h3 data-start=3D"4259" data-end=3D"4304">4.1 <code data-start=3D"4267" dat=
a-end=3D"4275">strace</code> =E2=80=94 tracer les appels syst=C3=A8mes</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"4306" data-end=3D"4323">Pr=C3=A9sentation</h4>
