<hr data-start=3D"6074" data-end=3D"6077">
<h2 data-start=3D"6079" data-end=3D"6117">7. Optimisation et bonnes pratiqu=
es</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6119" data-end=3D"6660">
<li data-start=3D"6119" data-end=3D"6214">
<p data-start=3D"6121" data-end=3D"6214"><strong data-start=3D"6121" data-e=
nd=3D"6135">Indexation</strong> : configurer le rollover d=E2=80=99index da=
ns Elasticsearch pour =C3=A9viter la saturation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6215" data-end=3D"6309">
<p data-start=3D"6217" data-end=3D"6309"><strong data-start=3D"6217" data-e=
nd=3D"6237">Filtres Logstash</strong> : filtrer et enrichir les logs pour g=
arder uniquement ce qui est utile.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6310" data-end=3D"6398">
<p data-start=3D"6312" data-end=3D"6398"><strong data-start=3D"6312" data-e=
nd=3D"6324">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong> : activer TLS et authentification e=
ntre les composants ELK en production.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6399" data-end=3D"6476">
<p data-start=3D"6401" data-end=3D"6476"><strong data-start=3D"6401" data-e=
nd=3D"6415">Ressources</strong> : ajuster la m=C3=A9moire JVM d=E2=80=99Ela=
sticsearch selon votre charge.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6477" data-end=3D"6596">
<p data-start=3D"6479" data-end=3D"6596"><strong data-start=3D"6479" data-e=
nd=3D"6490">Alertes</strong> : configurer Watcher (X-Pack) ou Elastic Alert=
s dans Kibana pour =C3=AAtre notifi=C3=A9 en cas d=E2=80=99erreurs critique=
s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6597" data-end=3D"6660">
<p data-start=3D"6599" data-end=3D"6660"><strong data-start=3D"6599" data-e=
nd=3D"6627">Rotation des logs Docker</strong> : =C3=A9viter saturation des =
disques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6662" data-end=3D"6665">
<h2 data-start=3D"6667" data-end=3D"6688">8. Exemple complet</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6690" data-end=3D"6747">Voici un r=C3=A9sum=C3=A9 des =C3=
=A9tapes =C3=A0 suivre pour un setup local :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6749" data-end=3D"7144">
<li data-start=3D"6749" data-end=3D"6812">
<p data-start=3D"6752" data-end=3D"6812">Cr=C3=A9er <code data-start=3D"675=
8" data-end=3D"6778">docker-compose.yml</code> avec ELK + Filebeat + Metric=
beat.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6813" data-end=3D"6883">
<p data-start=3D"6816" data-end=3D"6883">Configurer Logstash (<code data-st=
art=3D"6837" data-end=3D"6852">logstash.conf</code>) et Filebeat (<code dat=
a-start=3D"6867" data-end=3D"6881">filebeat.yml</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6884" data-end=3D"6924">
<p data-start=3D"6887" data-end=3D"6924">D=C3=A9marrer avec <code data-star=
t=3D"6901" data-end=3D"6923">docker-compose up -d</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6925" data-end=3D"6965">
<p data-start=3D"6928" data-end=3D"6965">Configurer index pattern dans Kiba=
na.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6966" data-end=3D"7026">
<p data-start=3D"6969" data-end=3D"7026">Construire dashboards avec visuali=
sations personnalis=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7027" data-end=3D"7077">
<p data-start=3D"7030" data-end=3D"7077">Surveiller vos logs et m=C3=A9triq=
ues en temps r=C3=A9el.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7078" data-end=3D"7144">
<p data-start=3D"7081" data-end=3D"7144">Optimiser en filtrant les logs, aj=
ustant ressources et alertes.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"7146" data-end=3D"7149">
<h2 data-start=3D"7151" data-end=3D"7167">9. Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7169" data-end=3D"7464">L=E2=80=99int=C3=A9gration de Dock=
er avec la stack ELK offre une solution robuste pour la collecte, la centra=
lisation et l=E2=80=99analyse des logs et m=C3=A9triques de vos conteneurs.=
 Elle facilite grandement le debugging, le monitoring et l=E2=80=99optimisa=
tion, notamment dans les environnements complexes et =C3=A0 grande =C3=A9ch=
elle.</p>
<p data-start=3D"7466" data-end=3D"7620">N=E2=80=99h=C3=A9sitez pas =C3=A0 =
approfondir les fonctionnalit=C3=A9s avanc=C3=A9es d=E2=80=99Elasticsearch,=
 Logstash et Kibana, ainsi qu=E2=80=99=C3=A0 automatiser cette stack dans v=
os pipelines CI/CD.</p>
